Z||000002||MD_Fiero||07-31-2001||12:11 AM||||im not really looking for a replica, full body kit.....would this rear fit my 86' 2m4?<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/gallery/Mods/Novascotia.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/gallery/Mods/Novascotia.jpg</A> <P><BR> thanks||||reg||1
Z||000003||Hartz||07-31-2001||12:20 AM||||That's just a standard 85 GT/86-87 SE body with a Sundance/Shadow rear spoiler, and, not too sure on this one, (someone who knows for sure jump in) but it LOOKS like an old Mopar 6 pak hoodscoop. <P>All the Fiero body parts interchange, so yes, it would fit.  Just be careful about matching up ribbed vs. smooth side mouldings.<P>Does anyone have any additional pics of this car?  I kinda like the rear wing.<P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo||||reg||1
